[mattpocock/skills](https://github.com/mattpocock/skills) at pinned commit
`6fd947921b935b7e1e69293a200400f0fdd5c15f`, used under the MIT License.
Earlier releases used `0ab1b63a410a03d3627979a109c8695de27af954`.
